analysis.out
KS-22 - trelica XZ e flexao local do banzo - N m
StaticStructural nsteps 2 deltat 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dBeam
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 7 nelem 4 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 4 nic 0 nltf 3 nset 5
# A, B, C e a estacao central do banzo AB.
Node 1 coords 3 0 0 0
Node 2 coords 3 6 0 0
Node 3 coords 3 3 0 4
Node 4 coords 3 3 0 0
# Nos coincidentes em A, B e C compartilham UX e UZ e tem rotacoes independentes.
RigidArmNode 5 coords 3 0 0 0 master 1 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 0 doftype 3 2 2 0
RigidArmNode 6 coords 3 6 0 0 master 2 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 0 doftype 3 2 2 0
RigidArmNode 7 coords 3 3 0 4 master 3 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 0 doftype 3 2 2 0
Beam2d 1 nodes 2 1 4
Beam2d 2 nodes 2 4 2
Beam2d 3 nodes 2 5 3
Beam2d 4 nodes 2 6 7
SimpleCS 1 area 0.001 Iy 0.000025 beamShearCoeff 1.e18 material 1 set 1
IsoLE 1 d 7850 E 2.e11 n 0.3 tAlpha 0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 3 values 2 0 0 set 2
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 3 values 1 0 set 3
NodalLoad 3 loadTimeFunction 2 dofs 1 3 Components 1 -10000 set 4
ConstantEdgeLoad 4 loadTimeFunction 3 Components 3 0 -10000 0 loadType 3 csType 1 set 5
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
PeakFunction 2 t 1. f(t) 1.
PeakFunction 3 t 2. f(t) 1.
Set 1 elements 4 1 2 3 4
Set 2 nodes 1 1
Set 3 nodes 1 2
Set 4 nodes 1 3
Set 5 elementedges 4 1 1 2 1
